 12pt;\">CHS Girls Kamachha Varanasi</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9558%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Class 11 (Math)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.4085%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">13 Seats</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 42.6356%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CHS Boys Kamachha Varanasi</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9558%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Class 11 (Biology)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.4085%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">27 Seats</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 42.6356%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CHS Girls Kamachha Varanasi</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9558%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Class 11 (Biology)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.4085%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">13 Seats</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 42.6356%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CHS Boys Kamachha Varanasi</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9558%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Class 11 (Arts)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.4085%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">14 Seats</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 42.6356%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CHS Girls Kamachha Varanasi</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9558%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Class 11 (Arts)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.4085%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">15 Seats</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 42.6356%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CHS Boys Kamachha Varanasi</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9558%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Class 11 Commerce</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.4085%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">13 Seats</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 42.6356%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CHS Girls Kamachha Varanasi</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9558%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Class 11 Commerce</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.4085%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">20 Seats</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>BHU CHS SET Admission 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.8481%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Class&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.1519%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.8481%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Bal Vatika 2</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.1519%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Students who have not born before 31 March 2021 and after 31 March 2022 will be eligible for this admission.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.8481%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Bal Vatika 3</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.1519%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Students who have not born before 31 March 2020 and after 31 March 2021 will be eligible for this admission.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.8481%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For Class I</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.1519%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Students who have not born before 31 March 2018 and after 31 March 2020 will be eligible for this admission.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.8481%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For Class VI&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.1519%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Students who have not born before 31 March 2014 and after 31 March 2016 will be eligible for this admission.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Passed class 5 examination from a school.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.8481%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For Class IX</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.1519%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Students who have passed their Class VIII Examination form any school will be eligible for this entrance examination.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">13 Years to 15 years of age as on 31.03.2026 i.e. date of birth should not be before 31.03.2011 and after 31.03.2013 (Child born on 1st April, 2013 will also be considered.)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.8481%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For Class XI</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.1519%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Students who have passed their Class X Examination form any recognized board and scored above or equivalent &nbsp;60% marks or equivalent grade for Science Stream &amp; have scored above&nbsp; 50% marks&nbsp; or equal grade&nbsp; for Science &amp; Mathematics &amp; scored above or equal grade 55% marks for Commerce Stream will be eligible for this entrance examination.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BHU CHS SET Online Form 2026 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>E-Lottery</li>\n<li>Entrance Exam</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download BHU CHS SET Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Check the Important Links section.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then click on the Download Result link.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the Dashboard page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Candidate’s Registration Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Gender</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Verification Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates will be required to submit the details in order to download the result.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">The candidate can also download their result download from the official Website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"cente